  "description": "<p><strong>Scenario:</strong> A character who is already proficient in Acrobatics can call on drilled muscle memory for an extra 1d4 on their own Acrobatics check. This demonstrates skill.prof; unproficient and half-proficient characters do not qualify.</p><p><strong>Setup:</strong> Drag this Active Effect onto the actor who should own the External Reaction option. All changes use Override mode. If an option has a count requirement, that resource is spent when the option is accepted, according to External Reaction's count handling.</p>",
